## Bundled third-party software

This installer ships two upstream binaries unmodified. They are
licensed independently:

- **yt-dlp** — Unlicense (public domain dedication). Source:
  https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp
- **ffmpeg** — GPL v3 or LGPL v2.1+ depending on build flags.
  This release bundles a GPL-v3 build. Source and license:
  https://ffmpeg.org/legal.html · https://www.ffmpeg.org/download.html

Their respective licenses ship as-is with the binaries — they are
not relicensed by inclusion here.
